Unknown error.","invalidYtId":"Invalid YouTube ID.","unknownYtId":"Unable to find video with the given YouTube ID.","restrictedYt":"The owner of this video does not allow it to be embedded."},"sources":[{"path":"videos\/sources-689b86710eaf9.mp4","mime":"video\/mp4","copyright":{"license":"U"}}]},"subContentId":"9d5c06fc-467c-420d-b9c2-f78796d96862","metadata":{"contentType":"Video","license":"U","title":"Scenario A"}},"showContentTitle":false,"proceedButtonText":"Proceed","forceContentFinished":"useBehavioural","feedback":{"title":"<p>Privacy Breach!&nbsp;<\/p>","subtitle":"<p>This is a clear <strong>privacy breach<\/strong>. Discussing Dave's mental state in a casual, non-private setting is a violation of her rights under privacy laws and workplace policy. &nbsp;This moment damages trust not only between Mary and Dave, but also the agency and its clients.<\/p>","image":{"path":"images\/image-689b87ae03059.jpg","mime":"image\/jpeg","copyright":{"license":"U"},"width":612,"height":433}},"contentBehaviour":"useBehavioural","nextContentId":18},{"type":{"library":"H5P.Video 1.6","params":{"visuals":{"fit":false,"controls":true},"playback":{"autoplay":true,"loop":false},"l10n":{"name":"Video","loading":"Video player loading...","noPlayers":"Found no video players that supports the given video format.","noSources":"Video is missing sources.","aborted":"Media playback has been aborted.","networkFailure":"Network failure.","cannotDecode":"Unable to decode media.","formatNotSupported":"Video format not supported.","mediaEncrypted":"Media encrypted.","unknownError":"Unknown error.","invalidYtId":"Invalid YouTube ID.","unknownYtId":"Unable to find video with the given YouTube ID.","restrictedYt":"The owner of this video does not allow it to be embedded."},"sources":[{"path":"videos\/sources-689b86e503e2d.mp4","mime":"video\/mp4","copyright":{"license":"U"}}]},"subContentId":"5b3b5c23-1612-4f72-909d-6b20c9f3bfe8","metadata":{"contentType":"Video","license":"U","title":"Scenario B"}},"showContentTitle":false,"proceedButtonText":"Proceed","forceContentFinished":"useBehavioural","feedback":{"title":"<p>Correct Choice!&nbsp;<\/p>","subtitle":"<p>This response respects Dave's privacy and demonstrates your understanding of confidentiality boundaries. &nbsp;Only those directly involved in a consumer\u2019s care \u2014 the <em>circle of care<\/em> \u2014 are entitled to personal health information. Casual conversations in communal spaces like a lunchroom aren\u2019t safe spaces to share this info, even with other staff.<\/p>","image":{"path":"images\/image-689b87890784b.jpg","mime":"image\/jpeg","copyright":{"license":"U"},"width":1000,"height":1000}},"contentBehaviour":"useBehavioural","nextContentId":18},{"type":{"library":"H5P.Video 1.6","params":{"visuals":{"fit":false,"controls":true},"playback":{"autoplay":true,"loop":false},"l10n":{"name":"Video","loading":"Video player loading...","noPlayers":"Found no video players that supports the given video format.","noSources":"Video is missing sources.","aborted":"Media playback has been aborted.","networkFailure":"Network failure.","cannotDecode":"Unable to decode media.","formatNotSupported":"Video format not supported.","mediaEncrypted":"Media encrypted.","unknownError":"Unknown error.","invalidYtId":"Invalid YouTube ID.","unknownYtId":"Unable to find video with the given YouTube ID.","restrictedYt":"The owner of this video does not allow it to be embedded."},"sources":[{"path":"videos\/sources-689b871f26bcf.mp4","mime":"video\/mp4","copyright":{"license":"U"}}]},"subContentId":"0c212368-3a09-4a62-b916-60ee68a93d0a","metadata":{"contentType":"Video","license":"U","title":"Scenario C"}},"showContentTitle":false,"proceedButtonText":"Proceed","forceContentFinished":"useBehavioural","feedback":{"title":"<p>Privacy Breach!&nbsp;<\/p>","subtitle":"<p>This is a <strong>privacy breach<\/strong>. &nbsp;While it might seem like casual conversation, this reveals private emotional and health-related information \u2014 a breach of confidentiality. &nbsp;This can damage trust between the Consumer and Attendant.&nbsp;<\/p>","image":{"path":"images\/image-689b87502e6b1.jpg","mime":"image\/jpeg","copyright":{"license":"U"},"width":612,"height":433}},"contentBehaviour":"useBehavioural","nextContentId":18},{"type":{"library":"H5P.CoursePresentation 1.25","params":{"presentation":{"slides":[{"elements":[{"x":1.2738853503184715,"y":5.032636648666602,"width":50.955414012738856,"height":25.163183243333012,"action":{"library":"H5P.AdvancedText 1.1","params":{"text":"<p><span style=\"font-size:1.75em;\"><strong>Lets Try Another Scenario!<\/strong><\/span><\/p>"},"subContentId":"64000434-2e11-40f9-99c8-35e45c868c97","metadata":{"contentType":"Text","license":"U","title":"Lets Try Another Scenario!!"}},"alwaysDisplayComments":false,"backgroundOpacity":0,"displayAsButton":false,"buttonSize":"big","goToSlideType":"specified","invisible":false,"solution":""},{"x":1.2738853503184715,"y":20.13054659466641,"width":90.44585987261146,"height":52.84268481099933,"action":{"library":"H5P.AdvancedText 1.1","params":{"text":"<p><span style=\"font-size:1.75em;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(230,230,230);\">Raquel is an attendant starting her shift with a consumer named <\/span><span style=\"font-size:1.75em;\"><strong>Jack<\/strong><\/span><span style=\"font-size:1.75em;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(230,230,230);\">. She recently visited Carla, another consumer who\u2019s been having health issues. &nbsp;Jack is curious about Carla\u2019s situation and asks Raquel (the attendant) what\u2019s going on with Carla.&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>"},"subContentId":"8176c2fe-3d71-47b4-b4b9-79521c99d607","metadata":{"contentType":"Text","license":"U","title":"Untitled Text"}},"alwaysDisplayComments":false,"backgroundOpacity":0,"displayAsButton":false,"buttonSize":"big","goToSlideType":"specified","invisible":false,"solution":""}],"slideBackgroundSelector":{"fillSlideBackground":""}}],"keywordListEnab